            E("Ni Stremio 4 ni navigateur compatible trouvé. Installe Stremio 4 (.deb) ou Google Chrome / Chromium, puis relance.", "Neither Stremio 4 nor a compatible browser was found. Install Stremio 4 (.deb) or Google Chrome / Chromium, then restart.",
